# Objective 3 (warnings): compiles, but has the security smells the checker
# was built to catch: duplicates, redundancy, conflicts, dead rules, unused names.
SUBJECT admin, analyst, intern, vendor, auditor          # expect: W106  auditor is never used
RESOURCE reports SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE payroll SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE archive SUPPORTS READ                           # expect: W106  archive is never used

ALLOW admin ACCESS reports
ALLOW admin WRITE reports                                # expect: W102  already covered by ACCESS
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN authenticated AND on_vpn
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN on_vpn AND authenticated # expect: W101  same rule, reordered
ALLOW intern READ reports WHEN supervised
DENY intern READ reports WHEN after_hours                # expect: W103  conflicts when both hold
DENY vendor ACCESS payroll
ALLOW vendor READ payroll WHEN invoice_open              # expect: W104  the DENY always wins
